# Static security headers for Workers Static Assets (Cloudflare `_headers`).
#
# Parsed by Workers Assets and applied to static asset responses only.
# Worker-generated responses (/api/*, /identity/*, ...) do NOT get these
# headers, per Cloudflare Docs (Custom Headers section).
#
# Note: a few Worker responses set X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
# individually (src/handlers/icons.rs, src/handlers/streaming.rs).
#
# Do not serve this file itself.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
